@startuml SpeakSteps_State
!theme plain
title SpeakSteps - Patient Exercise Session State Diagram

[*] --> NotAuthenticated

NotAuthenticated --> Authenticating : sign in/sign up
Authenticating --> Authenticated : valid credentials
Authenticating --> NotAuthenticated : invalid credentials

Authenticated --> SelectingModule : user logged in

SelectingModule --> SelectingExercise : module chosen
SelectingExercise --> AttemptingQuestion : exercise loaded

state "Exercise Session" as session {
  AttemptingQuestion --> EvaluatingResponse : submit answer
  
  EvaluatingResponse --> CorrectAnswer : correct\n[high performance]
  EvaluatingResponse --> ProvidingCue : incorrect or slow\n[needs support]
  
  CorrectAnswer --> NextQuestion : save score
  
  ProvidingCue --> AttemptingQuestion : display cue\n[retry with support]
  ProvidingCue --> NextQuestion : max cue given\n[modeling shown]
  
  NextQuestion --> AttemptingQuestion : more questions
  NextQuestion --> SessionComplete : all done
}

SessionComplete --> ViewingProgress : display session stats

ViewingProgress --> SelectingModule : continue therapy
ViewingProgress --> [*] : sign out
Authenticated --> [*] : sign out

note right of EvaluatingResponse
  Cue Decision (Rules + ML):
  • Analyze response time & attempts
  • Check performance history
  • ML predicts cue probability
  • Select cue level (1-7)
end note

note right of ProvidingCue
  Cue Hierarchy (escalating):
  1. Functional → 2. Rhyming
  3. Written → 4. Spelling
  5. Sentence → 6. Phonemic
  7. Modeling (full answer)
end note

@enduml
